        {
          "text": "Ibagcwalisile ngokuhlakanipha ukuba benze imisebenzi yonke yombazi wamatshe, leyengcitshi, leyomthungi othunga ilembu eliluhlaza leliyibubende lelibomvu lelembu elihle, leyomaluki; benze imisebeni yonke loba yiyiphi leyabaqamba imisebenzi yobungcitshi.",
